  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Household Economy Analysis (HEA) project, aims to understand and improve the economic resilience of vulnerable households in target communities. The project will assess income sources, expenditure patterns, and coping mechanisms, informing programme design and policy advocacy to enhance household food security and livelihoods, ultimately reducing poverty and promoting sustainable development (SDG 1, SDG 2).</narrative>
